C"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1157688559207544", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031430_1157688562540877_5487867679010919630_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FUaNYc_XAigQ7kNvwGBLviB&_nc_oc=Adp4MtNmc2frGKbhxGPYbH8lRFuEHN_JCzGivH_QQ516hQAjNgk1blNbdVpnPihNnXE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKKt_gFunMcB4qmqLGIEM9AjQUCBTnsLdKMhk58KJaz3g&oe=6ABA8EC5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover_2560x1440.png", "id": "1088296552750042", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75348041_1088296556083375_5090998954574073554_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fWn7fGEWdq0Q7kNvwEO9Qi3&_nc_oc=AdrUY6-qLQ2lC868c482DErW-a1GEEchfgy8z9HnMZOAGnWMNL0P2H3WJqliHtp794Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLspW1K5PJzhKYjd3MBNqZUchN30ZUIgsscEnvlWo5L_Q&oe=6ABA8894"}, "display_name": "escape-from-x", "keywords": ["survival", "action", "military", "FPS"], "long_description": "Dive into Escape-from-X, where survival takes center stage in an immersive VR experience. Navigate a world where medicine, food, and hydration are crucial to your journey. From the early stages as a novice (\"Mladshi\") to becoming a top survival expert, every decision you make impacts your success. Your VR tablet acts as a real-world companion, helping you assist hideout NPCs and unravel the game's secrets. Inspired by the beloved Escape from Tarkov, Escape-from-X pushes the boundaries of VR UX with intuitive and groundbreaking features.", "short_description": "Experience immersive survival in Escape-from-X. Manage medicine, food, and hydration while making critical decisions as you progress from a novice to a skilled survival expert. Use your VR tablet as a real-world companion to aid NPCs and uncover the story. Inspired by Escape from Tarkov, this game redefines VR UX."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://badjoe